{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37385","headline":"舟中望紫岩 · 唐彦谦","name":"舟中望紫岩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"近山如画墙，远山如帚长。\n我从云中来，回头白茫茫。\n惜去乃尔觉，常时自相忘。\n相忘岂不佳，遣此怀春伤。\n飘洒从何来，衣巾湿微凉。\n初疑风雨集，冉冉游尘黄。\n无归亦自可，信美非吾乡。\n登舟望东云，犹向帆端翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}